  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n4X3EsE.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=5865F2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=252A36&amp;labelColor=FF424D&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=follow&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=1D9BF0&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p><p><strong>关于：</strong><br>为<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">\"<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">巨龙坐骑：传承</a>\"</span> 改进的纹理。<br>灵感来源于Jappa和Boss Refreshed，但融入了我个人风格，并且对FPS友好。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>特点：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>龙纹理灵感来源于<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/boss-refreshed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\"Boss Refreshed by lukidon\"</a></span> [可选纹理包]。</li>\n<li>改进的龙蛋模型和纹理。</li>\n<li>中世纪与原版风格兼备！！</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>希望你能喜欢。❤<br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qjW_AXqTmmM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"421\" width=\"421\"></iframe></span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JEEgj1uIkEY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"421\" width=\"421\"></iframe></span><br><br></p><p><strong>&nbsp;如果你喜欢我的像素画风格，还可以尝试：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala的 - 酿造指南开启</a> [原版]<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala的GUI - 暗色模式</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-white-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala的GUI - 白色模式</a><br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">CesarZorak的幻想矿石<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">CesarZorak的幻想矿石</a>&nbsp;[模组版]</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4r5WLBc.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></a><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></p><p><strong>💝 亲爱的赞助者</strong> <strong>💝</strong>&nbsp;</p><p><br><em>请记住，您可以在官方<a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala Creations Patreon</a>上支持我们，那里有即将推出的更新信息，<br>这有助于我们为您带来最佳质量的内容。</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EjFOwtq.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"550\"></p>",
